<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.4.8">
<l>aṉantaṉpāluṅ karuṭaṉpālu maitunoy tākavaitteṉ</l>
<l>maṉantaṉuḷḷē vantuvaiki vāḻacey tāyempirāṉ</l>
<l>niṉainteṉṉuḷ ḷēniṉṟunek kukkaṇka ḷacumpoḻuka</l>
<l>niṉaintiruntē ciramantīrntēṉ nēmine ṭiyavaṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Having made Ananta and Garuḍa insignificant,</l>
<l>you came to dwell inside my heart so that [I may] live.</l>
<l>Contemplating [this] my lord,</l>
<l>contemplating [the fact that you] remain in my heart,</l>
<l>[and my heart] melting, so that tears overflow from [my] eyes,</l>
<l>O Tall One with the discus, I have completed [my] toil.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
